{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2025-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1751328000, "end_date": 1751932799, "month_true_total": 2114, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:22:01 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199241571", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016385110", "personaname": "Axlo Wyatt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/axlowyatt/", "num_games_owned": 514, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2380, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1534, "last_played": 1753397217, "avatar": "4ee7db032b66fe294cea42cd29f13f8212537d9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "The combat is [b]visceral[/b], [b]weighty[/b], and [b]incredibly satisfying[/b]. Switching between ranged and melee attacks feels fluid and powerful, letting you mow down hordes of [b]Tyranids[/b] with thunderous bolter fire one moment and carve through them with a chainsword the next. Every weapon feels [b]unique[/b] and [b]impactful[/b], with just the right amount of over-the-top carnage.\r\nVisually, this game is a feast. The environments are [b]massive[/b], [b]grimdark masterpieces—gothic architecture[/b], devastated battlefields, and alien-infested worlds all brought to life in stunning detail. The character models, especially the [b]Primaris Space Marines[/b], are spot on. They look and move exactly how you'd imagine genetically enhanced warriors of the [b]Imperium[/b] should.", "timestamp_created": 1751930246, "timestamp_updated": 1751930246, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199241542", "author": {"steamid": "76561199235989565", "personaname": "Agnar_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199235989565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7466, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1658, "last_played": 1786316053, "avatar": "6a03fdd244c91eb8855c04abb8a47ffc0555ef1c"}, "language": "english", "review": "it is good", "timestamp_created": 1751930213, "timestamp_updated": 1751930213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199240547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128384892", "personaname": "Bruce", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128384892/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1767, "last_played": 1780199966, "avatar": "3e466f3dce7acede8e2c7b84c08bd6646b02c5db"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want a good time, if you want to have fun, complete missions, and feel empowered by the Ultramarines, this is the game for you. I was anxiously waiting for this release, and I can say it delivered on what it promised. However, I think they could have stuck to just the campaign and maybe added some DLCs. The multiplayer isn’t very enticing, the servers can barely keep up, and the wait times to start missions are long.\r\n\r\nTo make it more interesting, I suggest playing on Angel of Death. It’s not impossible, but if you want the campaign to truly challenge you, go for the hardest mode. I didn’t play the campaign with friends, but playing solo was a lot of fun—so I imagine it’s even better with a group.\r\n\r\nThis review isn’t for you. It’s for Ultramar!\r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1751929198, "timestamp_updated": 1751929198, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199238168", "author": {"steamid": "76561199750434362", "personaname": "Brother Ezekiel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199750434362/", "num_games_owned": 10, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 16122, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 702, "playtime_at_review": 584, "last_played": 1788980976, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "very fun", "timestamp_created": 1751926747, "timestamp_updated": 1751926747, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199237858", "author": {"steamid": "76561199274568777", "personaname": "Vae Victis", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199274568777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 19621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6100, "last_played": 1787385014, "avatar": "206073c6c8e1c07e7a28bf924c5a2e8627cc4e3b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm here to slaughter Xenos and post this review... and i'm done with the review.", "timestamp_created": 1751926441, "timestamp_updated": 1751926441, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199234003", "author": {"steamid": "76561199077079660", "personaname": "VAGVILLAIN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199077079660/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 12198, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 783, "last_played": 1785439694, "avatar": "10bd56bc3b0ad20bcbe76485f476fca24d61a4c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1751922812, "timestamp_updated": 1752388662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519774019718170166", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199233860", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128101101", "personaname": "corn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cornnny/", "num_games_owned": 783, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 566, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 566, "last_played": 1751915161, "avatar": "1824d544a2bb0010b75bc5f3161f4e9cae40b535"}, "language": "english", "review": "A perfect introduction to this world for someone who has never interacted with the Warhammer franchise (or ever wanted to). This has sort of \"broken the seal\" for me, meaning I would be up for exploring other games within this IP as long as they are not boring genres. The game has incredible visuals (both artistically and graphically) and has an impressive and satisfying gameplay feel; in the nicest way possible, it is the perfect example of an amazing 7/10 game.\n\nThe first 80% of the campaign is really solid with unique areas and gorgeous set pieces, but then the third act's cinematics and pacing start to become a lot less consistent and culminated in a generic ass final boss.\n\nDespite that, this is still a solid experience, and I can so see myself coming back to this every 6 months or so to just rip through some insects.", "timestamp_created": 1751922707, "timestamp_updated": 1751922707, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}]}